  "content": "\n\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zfojiw3.png\" alt=\"Creeper Overhaul Workmark\">\n\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/W758n8u.png\" alt=\"Creeper Overhaul Creepers Display\">\n\n<div>\n    <p><br><br></p>\n    <center>\n        <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/52LU4mv.png\" alt=\"About\">\n        <h4>Creeper Overhaul 将原版苦力怕替换为多种不同生物群系专属的苦力怕类型，有些比其他的更友善 :)</h4>\n        <iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/XIf8yMA1V2U\"\n                title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"encrypted-media; picture-in-picture; web-share\"\n                allowfullscreen></iframe>\n    </center>\n</div>\n\n<div>\n    <p><br><br></p>\n    <center>\n        <h3>你可能也会感兴趣</h3>\n    </center>\n    <center>\n        <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/creeper-overhaul\">\n            <img width=\"50%\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OMlhHaU.png\" alt=\"Creeper Overhaul Resourcepack\">\n        </a>\n        <h5>由 lord_gogomines 制作的资源包，将 Creeper Overhaul 的苦力怕引入原版 Minecraft！</h5>\n    </center>\n    <center>\n        <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/creeper-overhaul-overhaul\">\n            <img width=\"50%\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/jUxOI3S.png\" alt=\"Creeper Overhaul Overhaul\">\n        </a>\n        <h5>由 wadoo154 为 Creeper Overhaul 制作的粉丝动画资源包</h5>\n    </center>\n</div>\n\n<div>\n    <p><br></p>\n    <center>\n        <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mnnbI3S.png\" alt=\"Credits\">\n        <dl>\n          <br>\n            <dt>Josh/Joosh - 美术</dt>\n            <dt>ThatGravyBoat - 开发者</dt>\n            <dt>scratchy_sd - 全部苦力怕音效</dt>\n            <dt>ArkticBoi - 概念设计</dt>\n        </dl>\n    </center>\n</div>\n<div>\n    <p><br></p>\n    <center>     \n\n**<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZtjUq8p.png\" alt=\"Our Other Projects\">**\n\n[**Creatures and Beasts**](https://www.modrinth.com/mod/creatures-and-beasts) 一款向 Minecraft 添加奇妙生物的模组！<br>\n[**Critters and Companions**](https://www.modrinth.com/mod/critters-and-companions) 一款添加多种友好动物的模组！<br>\n[**Ghost**](https://www.modrinth.com/mod/ghost) 一款为你的世界添加两个友好幽灵生物的模组！<br>\n[**Golem Overhaul**](https://www.modrinth.com/mod/golem-overhaul) 一款添加 9 种新傀儡类型的模组！<br>\n[**Enderman Overhaul**](https://www.modrinth.com/mod/enderman-overhaul) 一款全面改造原版末影人的模组！<br>\n[**Nightlights**](https://www.modrinth.com/mod/nightlights) 一款向 Minecraft 添加多种新光源的模组！<br>\n[**Lookin' sharp**](https://www.modrinth.com/mod/lookin-sharp) 为游戏添加 60 把全新近战武器！<br>\n[**Ribbits**](https://www.modrinth.com/mod/ribbits) Ribbits 添加了新的沼泽村庄，里面住满了青蛙村民！\n<div>\n    <p><br></p>\n    <center>\n        <a href=\"https://discord.gg/sGwxnFV\">\n            <img width=\"10%\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/T4ltmGW.png\" alt=\"Discord\">\n        </a>\n        <a href=\"https://twitter.com/Joosh7889\">\n            <img width=\"10%\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ewzK3Zb.png\" alt=\"Twitter\">\n        </a>\n        <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCUvb1-kBGDEA1gVtd3UhlLg/videos\">\n            <img width=\"10%\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EirVdtZ.png\" alt=\"YouTube\">\n        </a>\n        <a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/bonsaistudios\">\n            <img width=\"10%\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/AEfwGvx.png\" alt=\"Kofi\">\n        </a>\n        <a href=\"https://mcmodels.net/vendors/29/joosh\">\n            <img width=\"10%\" src=\"https://imgur.com/pXWpwIb.png\" alt=\"Mcmodels\">\n        </a>\n    </center> <br>\n<div>",
